1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,786
Because the two limbs run in opposite directions, a small difference at each level is multiplied down the loop.

2
00:00:07,786 --> 00:00:14,791
The medulla builds a gradient from three hundred at the cortex to twelve hundred milliosmoles at the tip.

3
00:00:14,791 --> 00:00:20,937
The vasa recta run counter current too, so the blood does not wash the salt away.

